_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟡 Minor_

**Handle clipboard failures to avoid unhandled promise rejections.**

If copy fails, this path currently rejects silently and never reports state to users/devs.

<details>
<summary>🛡️ Proposed fix</summary>

```diff
+import { logger } from 'storybook/internal/client-logger';
...
   const handleCopyCode = useCallback(() => {
     if (copied) {
       return;
     }
-    copyToClipboard(withSource?.code ?? '').then(() => {
-      setCopied(true);
-      globalThis.window.setTimeout(() => setCopied(false), COPIED_LABEL_ANIMATION_DURATION);
-    });
+    copyToClipboard(withSource?.code ?? '')
+      .then(() => {
+        setCopied(true);
+        globalThis.window.setTimeout(() => setCopied(false), COPIED_LABEL_ANIMATION_DURATION);
+      })
+      .catch((err) => {
+        logger.error(err);
+      });
   }, [copied, copyToClipboard, withSource?.code]);
```
</details>


As per coding guidelines: "Use 'logger' from 'storybook/internal/client-logger' for client-side (browser) logging instead of console methods".

<!-- suggestion_start -->

<details>
<summary>📝 Committable suggestion</summary>

> ‼️ **IMPORTANT**
> Carefully review the code before committing. Ensure that it accurately replaces the highlighted code, contains no missing lines, and has no issues with indentation. Thoroughly test & benchmark the code to ensure it meets the requirements.

```suggestion
import { logger } from 'storybook/internal/client-logger';

const handleCopyCode = useCallback(() => {
  if (copied) {
    return;
  }
  copyToClipboard(withSource?.code ?? '')
    .then(() => {
      setCopied(true);
      globalThis.window.setTimeout(() => setCopied(false), COPIED_LABEL_ANIMATION_DURATION);
    })
    .catch((err) => {
      logger.error(err);
    });
}, [copied, copyToClipboard, withSource?.code]);
```

</details>

<!-- suggestion_end -->

<details>
<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>

```
